From: Mahendra Mali (Max) <max@maxnet.lan>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:06:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath11k: optimize data path ring buffer allocations for low memory footprints

================================================================================
MAXNET High-Performance Kernel Engine & Hardware Architecture Optimization
Engineered & Developed by Mahendra Mali (Max) for MAXNET Router OS
Copyright (c) 2026 Mahendra Mali - Max. All Rights Reserved.
================================================================================

Scale RXDMA buffer and monitor rings to save ~52MB of contiguous DMA RAM on 512MB platforms.

Signed-off-by: Mahendra Mali (Max) <max@maxnet.lan>
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/dp.h
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/dp.h
@@ -216,14 +216,19 @@
 #define DP_RX_RELEASE_RING_SIZE		1024
 #define DP_REO_EXCEPTION_RING_SIZE	128
 #define DP_REO_CMD_RING_SIZE		256
-#define DP_REO_STATUS_RING_SIZE		2048
-#define DP_RXDMA_BUF_RING_SIZE		4096
-#define DP_RXDMA_REFILL_RING_SIZE	2048
+/* MAXNET Memory Optimization by Mahendra Mali (Max):
+ * Scale data-path and monitor rings to balanced bounds (1024/512/256).
+ * Saves ~52MB of unmovable contiguous DMA memory across 3 radios.
+ * Copyright (c) 2026 Mahendra Mali - Max. All Rights Reserved.
+ */
+#define DP_REO_STATUS_RING_SIZE		1024
+#define DP_RXDMA_BUF_RING_SIZE		1024
+#define DP_RXDMA_REFILL_RING_SIZE	1024
 #define DP_RXDMA_ERR_DST_RING_SIZE	1024
-#define DP_RXDMA_MON_STATUS_RING_SIZE	1024
-#define DP_RXDMA_MONITOR_BUF_RING_SIZE	4096
-#define DP_RXDMA_MONITOR_DST_RING_SIZE	2048
-#define DP_RXDMA_MONITOR_DESC_RING_SIZE	4096
+#define DP_RXDMA_MON_STATUS_RING_SIZE	256
+#define DP_RXDMA_MONITOR_BUF_RING_SIZE	512
+#define DP_RXDMA_MONITOR_DST_RING_SIZE	256
+#define DP_RXDMA_MONITOR_DESC_RING_SIZE	512
 
 #define DP_RX_RELEASE_RING_NUM	3
 
